```
invalid.js:49:58 lint/style/useErrorCause ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━

  i The `cause` property is shadowing the original error from the `catch` clause.
  
